 # cfgmerge — lint, merge and explain layered INI/.env configuration
+
+Perl 5 with core modules only.
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+bin/cfgmerge lint base.ini .env
+bin/cfgmerge merge [--schema schema.ini [--strict]] [--set KEY=VALUE]... [--format ini|env] base.ini prod.env
+bin/cfgmerge get db.host base.ini prod.env
+bin/cfgmerge explain base.ini prod.env        # where every value came from
+bin/cfgmerge diff old.ini new.ini
+```
+
+Later files override earlier ones, `--set` overrides all files. Values may reference
+other keys (`${db.host}`), environment variables (`${env:HOME}`) and defaults
+(`${key:-fallback}`).
+
+## Tests
+
+```
+prove -l t
+```
